# LOOM-8 demo: modern pop, 110 BPM, C major (C G Am F). (tools/demos/render.sh renders it; its bank is
# build/demos/pop.bin: the hook sung in a bar and an "oh" to play as an instrument, both made by
# tools/demos/make_banks.py.)
#   T1 kit: kick, the clap as a snap (a snare under it in the chorus), eighth hats with rolls
#   T2 stack "ply bass": the bass, octave bounce in
#   the chorus     T3 tines "felt piano": the chords (whole notes, then eighths)     T4 slice: the hook in 16
#   T5 sample: "oh" (user 2, its root C5) played as a vocal-chop lead, the post-chorus drop
#   T6 wavetable "lace keys" through the arp (1/8, bounce, two octaves, latched), the chord held by hand each bar
#   T7 brocade "damask": the chorus's supersaw bed, pumped    T8 voile "doo wop": sings the drop's riff with T5
# Song: intro 2, verse 8, pre 2 (the build), chorus 8, drop 4 (the chop lead), outro 2.
master 4096
samples build/demos/pop.bin
bpm 110

# ---- the sounds (modern pop: clean and bright. A tight, tuned kick with a click, a snap of a clap with a snare
# under it in the chorus, crisp hats; the bass round and in mono, the piano and the pad warm, the hook up front
# with air on it; a short bright plate and a quarter-note echo, both kept low; the master loud and open)
# T1 the kit: the kick tuned to the key (C: 65 Hz), short and punchy; the clap high and tight; hats shimmering
knob 1 d1.k1 90
knob 1 d1.k2 46
knob 1 d1.k3 84
knob 1 d1.k4 92
knob 1 d2.k1 100
knob 1 d2.k2 30
knob 1 d2.k3 96
knob 1 d2.volume 62
knob 1 d5.k1 116
knob 1 d5.k2 44
knob 1 d5.k4 30
knob 1 d5.volume 82
knob 1 d3.k1 104
knob 1 d3.k2 20
knob 1 d3.k4 40
knob 1 d3.volume 70
knob 1 d4.k1 104
knob 1 d4.k4 40
knob 1 d4.k2 64
knob 1 d4.volume 64
knob 1 ftype dynamic
knob 1 cut 8
knob 1 res 66
knob 1 fenv 24
knob 1 level 93
knob 1 send2 10
# T2 stack "ply bass": round, a little brighter than its preset, mono in the middle
preset 2 dx_bass rayon
# (the song was written before a bass preset sat an octave down)
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 brain no
knob 2 cut 76
knob 2 level 103
# T3 tines "felt piano": the chords, opened up
preset 3 rayon rayon
knob 3 brain no
knob 3 cut 104
knob 3 level 86
knob 3 send1 10
knob 3 send2 24
# T4 the hook in 16 slices: up front, into a short plate
knob 4 engine slice
preset 4 jungle slice
knob 4 e1 u1
knob 4 e4 127
knob 4 vmode poly
knob 4 cut 127
knob 4 ctype tilt
knob 4 camt 76
knob 4 ctone 100
knob 4 cmix 127
knob 4 brain no
knob 4 level 102
knob 4 send1 20
knob 4 send2 26
# T5 the "oh" (user 2, its root C5) as a vocal-chop lead: short, pitched, a little drive for presence
knob 5 engine sample
knob 5 e1 u2
knob 5 e2 3
knob 5 e4 one-shot
knob 5 vmode poly
knob 5 a 0
knob 5 d 84
knob 5 s 50
knob 5 r 50
knob 5 cut 122
knob 5 ctype drive
knob 5 camt 34
knob 5 ctone 120
knob 5 cmix 127
knob 5 brain no
knob 5 level 107
knob 5 send1 30
knob 5 send2 24
# T6 wavetable "lace keys" through the arp: the plucks
preset 6 glass_keys jacquard
knob 6 brain no
knob 6 player arp
knob 6 p1 1/8
knob 6 p2 bounce
knob 6 p3 2
knob 6 p4 1
knob 6 ap4 narrow
knob 6 cut 110
knob 6 level 86
knob 6 send1 34
knob 6 send2 16
# T7 brocade "damask": the chorus's supersaw bed, opened up, pumped
preset 7 ribbon knit
knob 7 e1 5
knob 7 r 62
knob 7 cut 104
knob 7 brain no
knob 7 ltype pump
knob 7 lspeed track_1
knob 7 lamt 80
knob 7 level 84
knob 7 send2 30
# T8 voile "doo wop": the drop's riff with the chop lead
preset 8 ooh_choir voile
knob 8 brain no
knob 8 level 78
knob 8 send1 30
knob 8 send2 26
# FX I a quarter-note echo, bright, few repeats; FX II a short bright plate
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 88
knob 11 e3 44
knob 11 e4 100
knob 12 engine plate
knob 12 e1 76
knob 12 e3 70
knob 12 e4 44
# the master: air on top, the low end firm, the compressor gluing, loud
mst hi 78
mst lo 70
mst comp 64
mst level 110

# ---- T1 the kit: kick 1, hat 3, open 4, clap 5, tom 6/7
# P1 verse: light
pat 1 1 16 1 50 10
hits 1 1 1 x......x..x.....
hits 1 1 5 ....x.......x...
hits 1 1 3 x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.
# P2 chorus: fuller, a roll at the bar's end
pat 1 2 16 1 50 10
hits 1 2 1 x......x..x..x..
hits 1 2 5 ....X.......X...
hits 1 2 3 x.xxx.x.x.xxx.x.
hits 1 2 4 ......o.......o.
hits 1 2 2 ....x.......x...
trick 1 2 16 multiply 3
hits 1 2 3 ...............x
# P3 pre-chorus build, 2 bars: the clap in eighths then sixteenths, toms at the end
pat 1 3 32 1 50 10
hits 1 3 5 x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.|xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
hits 1 3 1 x...x...x...x...|x...x...x.......
hits 1 3 7 ................|............x.x.
hits 1 3 6 ................|.............x.x
trick 1 3 29 multiply 2
trick 1 3 30 multiply 2
trick 1 3 31 multiply 3
trick 1 3 32 multiply 4

