play 6 A4 on 100
play 6 C4 off
play 6 F4 off
play 6 A4 off
bars 0.75
throw stutter on mel 4
bars 0.25
throw stutter off mel 4
# drop 4: the chop lead; the arp let go, the piano's tails long again
knob 3 r 66
knob 6 p4 0
play 6 C4 on 1
play 6 C4 off
bars 3.5
throw echo on mel 5
bars 0.5
throw echo off mel 5
# outro 2: the hook through the echo
bars 1
throw echo on mel 4
bars 1
throw echo off mel 4
wait 3000
wavstop
stats
